icant trees located within public right-of-way which abuts the developed area shall be shown on the landscape plan.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"b952b3eb-16e1-5ec9-9dd6-3d78fd0e8e27"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.235.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.235.050","content_hash":"668093633a3882017a2a4b2dd0367cde1d5ba1e804b03055361b3489b36d08b1","heading":null,"ordinal":19,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.050:block:19","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.235.050","text":"(b) Certificate of Landscape Plan Approval and Appeal. If the Planning Director or designee determines following review of the landscape plan that the plan meets the provisions of this chapter then the Planning Director or designee shall issue a landscape plan certificate of approval.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"7f18a939-6a0d-537a-851f-66a937d1ce21"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.235.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.235.050","content_hash":"fe2810cf3037d747ca1e2c247e2ef1e93adea509abbd864c3c2f6f54c157c066","heading":null,"ordinal":20,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.050:block:20","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.235.050","text":"A developer who is aggrieved by the administration of this chapter may file an appeal with the Board of Zoning Appeals in accordance with the provisions of Chapter 2.220 TMC, Board of Zoning Appeals.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"2a1fc792-24a3-5935-930f-bf280d255c80"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.235.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.23